# HackHaste Shift Lock for Solaris console, Type 4.
# HackHaste keyboard layout. Dr. Marcus Roe, https://drm.cc/ . MIT License.
# Keystations are the US Type 4 numbers. Type 5 alphanumeric stations match.
# Caps (key 119) is Left Control. Physical Left Ctrl (key 76) is Shift Lock.
# AltGr follows the letter, same pairings as solaris_console/type_6.
# Partial map: function keys, keypad, shifts, and Delete are left alone.
